	(text "Footprint: Package_SO:TSSOP-10_3x3mm_P0.5mm is KiCad's land pattern for TI's DGS package (its description\ncites TI drawing MPDS035 and the DGS-packaged ADS1115). KiCad 10 has no footprint named VSSOP-10_3x3mm_P0.5mm.\n(check):\n- OD_CLAMP and rated voltage for the VG0832012 are firmware settings; keep battery current under the nPM1304 limit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1a92bbf3-78b4-4b07-af3e-3094f94d7e29")
	)
	(text "Haptics sheet (step 5): TI DRV2605L (VSSOP-10, DGS) on VSYS, I2C at 2.0 V. From TI datasheet SLOS854D."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ab222d5a-e888-4e93-9f3e-a3acd1a206f7")
	)
	(text "- VDD (pin 10) from VSYS with C501 1 uF; pin 6 VDD/NC tied to VDD as the datasheet allows.\n- REG (pin 1): internal 1.8 V regulator output, C502 1 uF required.\n- EN (pin 5) <- HAPT_EN (P2.05).\n- IN/TRIG (pin 4) tied to GND (datasheet: connect to GND if not used). Effects are triggered over I2C (GO bit).\n  HAPT_TRIG was dropped: ISP2454 pad 10 (P1.10) is in the lower outer row and cannot be routed without via-in-pad.\n- SDA/SCL on the shared bus; VIH = 1.3 V, so 2.0 V logic is fine. I2C address 0x5A.\n- OUT+ (7) / OUT- (9) to the LRA lead pads TP501 (LRA+) and TP502 (LRA-), 1.0 x 1.5 mm, hand-soldered.\n- MECHANICAL: the 9 mm LRA tape-down pad is a layout feature (bare area on an FR4 stiffener on island B),\n  not a schematic part. Motor: Vybronics VG0832012, taped with its own adhesive backing.\n- DO NOT switch the driver's VDD off: SDA, SCL, EN and IN/TRIG are limited to VDD + 0.3 V, so an unpowered\n  DRV2605L would be back-powered through its I2C pins and clamp the shared bus. Rev A keeps VDD on with EN low\n  (about 4 uA). Firmware blocks the motor while VBUS is present (VSYS then follows VBUS up to 5.5 V,\n  above the 5.2 V recommended maximum; abs max is 5.5 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 147.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fe5c6475-e3f1-46a2-b222-18305960513e")
	)
